## Parameter file for the nucleosome demo (demos/nucleosome_from_pdb).
##
## Everything from here to the DNA section at the end is the protein parameter
## set that ships with PIMMS, pimms/data/gcf_rje23_v14.prm, unchanged. The DNA
## section adds the four nucleotide bead types (a, c, g, t) that the pdb2pimms
## report for 1KX5 says the parameter file must define.
##

# TEMPERATURE   :  50  # temperature used for these parameters!

# v4 - v3 and v2 combined plus weakened aromatic:aromatic
# v5 extra: weakened F:F strengthed ARO:R
# v6 better solvation for proline

## ANGLE PENALTIES
